00:24:24.100 --> 00:24:27.920
And the real heart of the matter comes down to what's sitting in the denominator here,

00:24:27.920 --> 00:24:33.700
the difference between the square of the resonant frequency and the square of the light frequency.

00:24:33.700 --> 00:24:38.000
