00:24:48.580 --> 00:24:53.640
of your force lines up quite closely with what the swing wants to do.

00:24:53.640 --> 00:24:58.440
In this case, running the simulation, notice how the oscillations of that particle will

00:24:58.440 --> 00:25:03.760
